4. Final Kernel (Closed Form)
η(τ)
[
\eta(\tau)=C_0 + C_2 (\tau-1)^2 + C_4 (\tau-1)^4
]
η′(τ)
[
\eta'(\tau) = 2C_2 (\tau-1) + 4C_4 (\tau-1)^3
]
In fixed-point this becomes:
η_fp = C0_fp + C2_fpdx² + C4_fpdx⁴
ηp_fp = (2C2_fpdx + 4C4_fpdx³) >> 20
where:
    • dx = τ_fp – (1<<20)
    • all ops are integer-only
    • no overflow occurs over τ ∈ [0.5,1.5]

